# Service 40 host-side composition over landed modules only: Linux service V4
# startup, structural current-before-status ordering, and associated
# prepare/execute dispatch on the sole Host capacity journal.
# SOURCE_AUTHORED / NOT_RUN. Reconcile (host_linux_service_reconcile_v4) runs
# at startup over the offline fresh-epoch store inventory lent by the same
# admission (milestone_0019 M1-M3); after a PROVED reconcile the opener hands
# that inventory back (milestone_0021 PR1); the agent owner
# (host_linux_service_agent_v4, milestone_0021 PR2) composes the native launch
# behind `host_agent_invoke_v4`; see
# .spipe/simple_orchestrator/continuation_20261116/milestone_0016_service40/DESIGN.md and milestone_0017_service40_reconcile/DESIGN.md.
